#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:2
msgid "lmcache describe"
msgstr "lmcache describe"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``lmcache describe`` command shows the detailed status of a running "
"service. Two targets are supported:"
msgstr "``lmcache describe`` 命令显示正在运行的服务的详细状态。支持两个目标："

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:7
msgid ""
"``kvcache`` — the LMCache KV cache service (health, L1 storage, "
"registered models, L2 adapters)."
msgstr "``kvcache`` — LMCache KV Cache 服务（健康状况、L1 存储、注册的模型、L2 适配器）。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:9
msgid ""
"``engine`` — the inference engine (vLLM) LMCache is paired with (model, "
"context window, health, in-flight requests)."
msgstr "``engine`` — 推理引擎 (vLLM) 与 LMCache 配对的 (模型、上下文窗口、健康状况、正在处理的请求)。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:13
msgid "KV Cache Service (``kvcache``)"
msgstr "KV Cache 服务 (``kvcache``)"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:57 ../../source/cli/describe.rst:86
msgid "The output shows:"
msgstr "输出显示："

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:59
msgid "**Overview** — health status, engine type, chunk size."
msgstr "**概述** — 健康状态、引擎类型、块大小。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:60
msgid "**L1 storage** — capacity, usage, eviction policy, cached object count."
msgstr "**L1 存储** — 容量、使用情况、逐出策略、缓存对象数量。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Registered models** — per-model KV cache layout: a context-wide summary"
" followed by one kernel group section per kernel group, each with the "
"engine KV tensor shape (symbolic and concrete), attention backend, and "
"group geometry."
msgstr ""
"**注册模型** — 每个模型的 KV Cache 布局：一个上下文范围的摘要，后面跟着每个内核组的一个内核组部分，每个部分都有引擎 KV "
"张量形状（符号和具体）、注意力后端和组几何。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:64
msgid "**L2 adapters** — type, health, backend, stored objects, and utilization."
msgstr "**L2 适配器** — 类型、健康状况、后端、存储对象和利用率。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:67
msgid "Inference Engine (``engine``)"
msgstr "推理引擎 (``engine``)"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:69
msgid ""
"``describe engine`` inspects the vLLM inference engine instead of the "
"LMCache service, reading only the engine's own HTTP endpoints "
"(``/v1/models``, ``/health``, ``/metrics``)."
msgstr "``describe engine`` 检查 vLLM 推理引擎，而不是 LMCache 服务，仅读取引擎自身的 HTTP 端点（``/v1/models``、``/health``、``/metrics``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Model** and **Max context** — the served model id and its maximum "
"context length, from ``/v1/models``."
msgstr "**模型** 和 **最大上下文** — 提供的模型 ID 及其最大上下文长度，来自 ``/v1/models``。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:90
msgid "**Status** — ``OK`` / ``UNHEALTHY`` from the engine's ``/health`` probe."
msgstr "**状态** — ``OK`` / ``UNHEALTHY`` 来自引擎的 ``/health`` 探针。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Running requests** — in-flight requests, summed from the "
"``vllm:num_requests_running`` metric. Shows ``N/A`` if metrics are "
"disabled or unreachable."
msgstr "**运行请求** — 正在进行的请求，从 ``vllm:num_requests_running`` 指标中汇总。如果指标被禁用或无法访问，则显示 ``N/A``。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:95
msgid ""
"Only the ``/v1/models`` fetch is required: if ``/health`` or ``/metrics``"
" is unavailable the command still reports what it can rather than "
"failing."
msgstr "仅需要 ``/v1/models`` 获取：如果 ``/health`` 或 ``/metrics`` 不可用，命令仍会报告它能提供的信息，而不是失败。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:115
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:121
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "标志"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:122
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:123
msgid "``target``"
msgstr "``target``"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:124
msgid "What to describe (positional, required): ``kvcache`` or ``engine``."
msgstr "描述内容（位置参数，必需）：``kvcache`` 或 ``engine``。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:125
msgid "``--url``"
msgstr "``--url``"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:126
msgid ""
"Server URL. Defaults per target: ``http://localhost:8080`` for "
"``kvcache``, ``http://localhost:8000`` for ``engine``."
msgstr "服务器 URL。默认值根据目标而定：``kvcache`` 的默认值为 ``http://localhost:8080``，``engine`` 的默认值为 ``http://localhost:8000``。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:128
msgid "``--format``"
msgstr "``--format``"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:129
msgid "Output format: ``terminal`` (default) or ``json``."
msgstr "输出格式：\\ ``terminal``\\ （默认）或\\ ``json``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:130
msgid "``--output PATH``"
msgstr "``--output PATH``"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:131
msgid "Save metrics to a file (format follows ``--format``)."
msgstr "将指标保存到文件中（格式遵循 ``--format``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:132
msgid "``-q`` / ``--quiet``"
msgstr "``-q`` / ``--quiet``"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:133
msgid "Suppress stdout output. Exit code only."
msgstr "抑制标准输出。仅返回退出代码。"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:136
msgid "JSON Output"
msgstr "JSON 输出"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:138
msgid ""
"Use ``--format json`` for machine-readable output. Models, kernel groups,"
" and L2 adapters are collected into lists for easy programmatic access:"
msgstr "使用 ``--format json`` 以机器可读的输出格式。模型、内核组和 L2 适配器被收集到列表中，以便于程序化访问："

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:197
msgid "Engine KV Shape Abbreviations"
msgstr "引擎 KV 形状缩写"

#: ../../source/cli/describe.rst:199
msgid ""
"The ``engine_kv_shape`` field uses short names from the "
"``EngineKVFormat`` enum:"
msgstr "``engine_kv_shape`` 字段使用来自 ``EngineKVFormat`` 枚举的短名称："

